    "body": "In \"4.5.26 The span element\";\r\n> Content model:\r\n> If the element is a descendant of an option element: Zero or more option element inner content elements, except div elements.\r\n> Otherwise: Phrasing content.\r\n\r\n ↓should be changed\r\n\r\n> Content model:\r\n> Phrasing content.\r\n\r\nBecause the descendants are restricted in the content model of the option element, there is no need to define them again in the span element.\r\n",
