    "body": "Re @mtrootyy's https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12504#issuecomment-4604263481:\r\n\r\nI wrote earlier that:\r\n> I was thinking of making an additional PR to restructure the way the div aspect works that I thought would be a little more questionable than this PR, so I wanted to separate it out into a second one.)\r\n\r\nI think this proposal is roughly what I was thinking of putting into that second PR.  (At the very least, what I'm reading from the edits you propose is that you make the `div` content model transparent for these cases, which in turn allows eliminating the additional category definitions, and the rest of the changes follow from eliminating the categories.)\r\n\r\nI think it might still be easier to review as a separate PR, particularly given that this one is mostly reviewed at this point.  (I thought it might be controversial because of the conditional use of transparent.  Although maybe there was another reason I was concerned about it that I've now forgotten?)",
